name: Telescope — targeted planet packs
author: corpus
description: >-
  Telescope makes Celestial Packs always contain the Planet for your most played poker hand.
  First-shop planet engine: pair with Constellation, Astronomer, and Satellite.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: Telescope
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - joker: Constellation
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Astronomer
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Satellite
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
